    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8652;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mover><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8652;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mover><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8652;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mover><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8652;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mover><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8652;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mover><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.58</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.9</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p>Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Equilibrium constant for formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />So equilibrium constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfenced></math> for dissociation<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;of&#160;</mtext><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mtext>&#160;is&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mstyle></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>26</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OMR</mi></math>&nbsp;Ans <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;(After rounded off to the nearest integer)</p>"
